{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031790/extras/72d726dd7f631abb86365f4de63939d3.avif?t=1760081015\" data-has-big width=1560 height=108 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you see that cheeky grin and clenched fists?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s the youngest sibling \u2014 now joining Twins of the Sun as a fully playable character through this DLC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This DLC includes the following:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A new playable hero with a distinct ranged combat style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Full replayability \u2013 experience the campaign again using her unique abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A fresh dynamic in local co-op \u2013 mix melee and ranged play for varied strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Expanded variety and challenge \u2013 certain encounters feel completely different with her magic-based combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> This is a single-character DLC. It does not add new stages or maps, but fully integrates the youngest sibling into the campaign with her permanent Wand of the Gods and unique ranged playstyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031790/extras/f0bc8a6b182f7d992e4d21960621cfaf.poster.avif?t=1760081015\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031790/extras/f0bc8a6b182f7d992e4d21960621cfaf.webm?t=1760081015\" type=\"video/